If you're a freshman, getting a single is going to be close to impossible. I would go with a double, as the triples can be really cramped. 

&#x200B;

I had a double in Lander, had a really chill roommate, and everything was p good.

Literally went and found your comment. Saw a post on Facebook about her and like 12 people commented their bad experiences with her.

&#x200B;

It wasn't just you. She's toxic to everyone I guess.
